@CTX:[DOM:PROJECT_LLAMA_INDEX_RS|SUB:DESIGN_SPEC|GOAL:AI_NATIVE_REFINERY]
@TARGET_REPLACEMENT
- [LlamaIndex] -> Trait-based Modular Orchestrator
- [Sentence-Transformers] -> Candle-based In-binary Embedding
- [Pydantic] -> Serde-based Static Schema
- [BeautifulSoup] -> Reqwest-scraper Streaming
- [VectorDBs] -> LanceDB Embedded Storage (Blocked by ENV: missing protoc)

@ROBUSTNESS_STATUS
- [Lock Poisoning] -> Resolved: All RwLock/Mutex usages use explicit error handling.
- [Atomic Write] -> Implemented for IndexStore.
- [Content ID] -> Implemented via Blake3.

@COMPONENTS_DETAIL
...

[[CORE_NODE]]
- Content: Raw Bitstream (Optional)
- ID: Blake3 Hash (Content Determinism)
- Vector: Vec<f16> (Memory Optimization)
- Metadata: Bit-packed Enum Tags (Aesthetic/Genre)

[[STREAM_REFINER]]
- Input: URL/Stream
- Process: Online Tokenization -> Embedding (No Temp File)
- Output: Node Stream

[[INDEX_ENGINE]]
- Implementation: LanceDB (Apache Arrow)
- Logic: Semantic Filtering over Boolean Filtering
- Safety: Thread-safe, Async-native

@WBS
1. Physical: node.rs, types.rs, serialization.rs
2. Refinery: refiner.rs, embedder.rs (Candle), crawler.rs
3. Memory: storage.rs (LanceDB), index.rs
4. Integration: feeding.rs (to Lasada/LoRA)

@EOF
